 Jerusalem because they "would not" (<FU>#Mt 23:37|<Fu>).
 
 (TFG 285)

 <FU>#Mt 11:18,19|<Fu>
 
    <FB>For John came neither eating nor drinking, and they say, He hath a<Fb>
 <FB>demon.<Fb> Jesus and John each besought the people to prepare for the
