 of his great mission upon him, the great heart of our Lord took note of
 the sports of children (<FU>#Mt 11:16,17|<Fu>).
 
 (TFG 285-286)

 <FU>#Mt 11:20|<Fu>
 
    <FB>The cities wherein most of his mighty works were done.<Fb> That is to
