 (<FU>#Mt 5:21,22 10:15 Lu 11:47,48 Joh 9:41 15:22-24 Ro 2:12|<Fu>).
 
    <FB>Tyre and Sidon.<Fb> <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Mt 11:21|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 
 (TFG 287)

 <FU>#Mt 11:23|<Fu>
 
