       <FU>#Mt 16:13-20 Mr 8:27-30 Lu 9:18-21|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Caesarea Philippi.<Fb> <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Mr 8:27|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 
