 <FU>#Mr 2:23|<Fu>
 
 XXXVIII. JESUS DEFENDS DISCIPLES WHO PLUCK GRAIN ON THE SABBATH.
    (Probably while on the way from Jerusalem to Galilee.)
    <FU>#Mt 12:1-8 Mr 2:23-28 Lu 6:1-5|<Fu>
 
