 <FU>#Mr 6:14|<Fu>
 
 LXII. HEROD ANTIPAS SUPPOSES JESUS TO BE JOHN.
    <FU>#Mt 14:1-12 Mr 6:14-29 Lu 9:7-9|<Fu>
 
    <FB>King Herod.<Fb> Herod Antipas, son of Herod the Great.
 <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Lu 3:1|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 
 (TFG 369)

 <FU>#Mr 6:15|<Fu>
 
