 (TFG 372)

 <FU>#Mr 6:23|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Whatsoever thou shalt ask of me, I will give it thee, unto the half<Fb>
 <FB>of my kingdom.<Fb> The rashness of the king's promise is characteristic of
