 <FU>#Mr 6:43|<Fu>
 
    <FB>And they took up broken pieces, twelve basketfuls, and also of the<Fb>
 <FB>fishes.<Fb> <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Joh 6:12|<Fu>"<Fb>.

