 <FU>#Mr 14:18|<Fu>
 
 CXIX. JUDAS' BETRAYAL AND PETER'S DENIAL FORETOLD.
    (Jerusalem. Evening before the crucifixion.)
    <FU>#Mt 26:21-25,31-35 Mr 14:18-21,27-31 Lu 22:21-23,31-38|<Fu>
    <FU>#Joh 13:21-38|<Fu>
 
