 <FU>#Mr 14:22|<Fu>
 
 CXX. THE LORD'S SUPPER INSTITUTED.
    (Jerusalem. Evening before the crucifixion.)
    <FU>#Mt 26:26-29 Mr 14:22-25 Lu 22:19,20 1Co 11:23-26|<Fu>
 
