 echo of these words see <FU>#Jas 4:13-15|<Fu>.
 
 (TFG 320)

 <FU>#Lu 12:21|<Fu>
 
    <FB>So is he that layeth up treasure for himself, and is not rich toward<Fb>
 <FB>God.<Fb> To be rich in character is to be rich toward God. But we may be
