 (TFG 321)

 <FU>#Lu 12:23|<Fu>
 
    <FB>For the life is more than the food, and the body than the raiment.<Fb>
 See <FU>#Mt 6:25|<Fu>.
 

 <FU>#Lu 12:24|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Consider the ravens,<Fb> etc. <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Mt 6:26|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 

 <FU>#Lu 12:25|<Fu>
 
    <FB>And which of you by being anxious can add a cubit unto the measure<Fb>
