 (TFG 321)

 <FU>#Lu 12:35|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Let your loins be girded about.<Fb> The long Oriental robe had to be
 lifted up and girded at the waist before the feet could step quickly
 (<FU>#1Ki 18:46|<Fu>).
 
