 proselytes baptized themselves. 2. John baptized Jews and not
 Gentiles.
 
 (TFG 104)

 <FU>#Joh 1:27|<Fu>
 
    <FB><FI>Even<Fi> he that cometh after me.<Fb> That is, follows in that way which
 I as forerunner am preparing for him.
 
