 (TFG 196)

 <FU>#Joh 5:10|<Fu>
 
    <FB>So the Jews.<Fb> That is, the Jewish rulers. John frequently uses the
 term with this restricted meaning (<FU>#Joh 1:19 7:13 9:22 18:12,14|<Fu>). The
