 stated: 1. Want of will to come to Christ (<FU>#Joh 5:40|<Fu>). 2. Want
 of real love toward God, or desire for his honor (<FU>#Joh 5:41-43|<Fu>). 3.
 Love for the honor of men, rather than the honor of God
