 (TFG 439-440)

 <FU>#Joh 7:3,4|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Depart hence, and go into Judaea, that thy disciples also may behold<Fb>
 <FB>thy works which thou doest.<Fb> When we consider how Jesus had withdrawn
