 (TFG 455)

 <FU>#Joh 8:25|<Fu>
 
    <FB>They said therefore unto him, Who art thou? Jesus said unto them,<Fb>
 <FB>Even that which I have also spoken unto you from the beginning.<Fb> Jesus'
