 (TFG 485)

 <FU>#Joh 10:28,29|<Fu>
 
    <FB>And I give unto them eternal life; and they shall never perish,<Fb>
 <FB>and no one shall snatch <FI>them<Fi> out of my hand.<Fb> This passage is taken
