 (TFG 521)

 <FU>#Joh 11:16|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Thomas . . . who is called Didymus.<Fb> <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Mr 3:18|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 
    <FB>Let us also go, that we may die with him.<Fb> That is, die with Christ,
