 (TFG 654)

 <FU>#Joh 13:31,32|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Now is the Son of man glorified, and God is glorified in him.<Fb> The
 departure of Judas was the first step in the progress of the Lord's
 Passion, and in this moment of its beginning Jesus exults in the
