    <FB>Ye shall seek me,<Fb> etc. <FB>See TFG "<FU>#Joh 7:34|<Fu>"<Fb>.
 
 (TFG 654-655)

 <FU>#Joh 13:34,35|<Fu>
 
    <FB>A new commandment I give unto you.<Fb> As to this new commandment, love
 had been commanded before (<FU>#Le 19:18|<Fu>), but the Christian love here
