 (TFG 714)

 <FU>#Joh 19:5|<Fu>
 
    <FB>Behold, the man!<Fb> It was Pilate's original proposition to scourge
 Jesus and let him go (<FU>#Lu 23:16|<Fu>). Having already scourged him, he
