 (TFG 714)

 <FU>#Joh 19:6|<Fu>
 
    <FB>They cried out, saying, Crucify <FI>him,<Fi> crucify <FI>him!<Fi><Fb> Thus
 Pilate's expectation came to naught, for not one of the Jewish rulers 
 ever wavered in their demand for crucifixion.
 
