 (TFG 715)

 <FU>#Joh 19:8|<Fu>
 
    <FB>When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he was the more afraid.<Fb>
 The words of Jesus at <FU>#Joh 18:37|<Fu> and the message from his wife had
