 that joy set before Jesus, for which "he endured the cross, despising
 the shame, and is now set down at the right hand of the throne of God"
 (<FU>#Heb 12:2|<Fu>).
 
 (OCA 34)

 <FU>#Ac 2:29-31|<Fu>
 
    <FB>29-31.<Fb> Having exhibited, in the quotation from David, "the
