 <FU>#Ac 7:55|<Fu>
 
    (55) <FB>But he, being full of the Holy Spirit, looked steadfastly into<Fb>
 <FB>heaven, and saw the glory of God, and Jesus standing at the right hand<Fb>
 <FB>of God,<Fb>
 

 <FU>#Ac 7:56|<Fu>
 
