 the eleventh chapter (<FU>#Ac 11:15|<Fu>):
 
    <FB>Then Peter answered,<Fb> (47) <FB>Can any man forbid water, that these<Fb>
 <FB>should not be immersed, who have received the Holy Spirit as well as<Fb> 
 <FB>we?<Fb>
 
