 <FB>and entered into the city, and the next day he went out with Barnabas<Fb> 
 <FB>into Derbe.<Fb>
 
 (OCA 176)

 <FU>#Ac 14:21,22|<Fu>
 
    <FB>21, 22.<Fb> Having been compelled to fly from Antioch to Iconium, and
