 {g} Conybeare and Howson, vol. 1, p. 227, <FI>et seq.<Fi>
 
 (OCA 181-182)

 <FU>#Ac 15:3|<Fu>
 
    <FB>3.<Fb> Their journey to Jerusalem, which was accomplished by land, lay
