 (OCA 191)

 <FU>#Ac 15:39|<Fu>
 
    (39) <FB>Then there was a contention, so that they separated one from<Fb>
 <FB>the other: and Barnabas took Mark and sailed into Cyprus.<Fb>
 
    By returning with Mark to his native land, Barnabas revisited a
