 <FU>#Ac 15:40|<Fu>
 
    (40) <FB>But Paul chose Silas, and departed, having been commended to<Fb>
 <FB>the favor of God by the brethren;<Fb>
 
    We turn with Luke to follow the history of him who was in labors
