 <FU>#Ac 19:18-20|<Fu>
 
    <FB>18-20.<Fb> The exposure of the seven exorcists reflected discredit upon
 all the pretenders to magic in Ephesus, while the name of Jesus was
 magnified. The effects upon the public mind were immense and
