 <FU>#Ac 19:20|<Fu>
 
    (20) <FB>So mightily did the word of God grow and prevail.<Fb>
 

 <FU>#Ac 19:21,22|<Fu>
 
    <FB>21, 22.<Fb> The conclusion of the preceding events brought Paul to a
