 The ship would now be called the Castor and Pollux.
 
 (OCA 289)

 <FU>#Ac 28:12|<Fu>
 
    (12) <FB>And landing at Syracuse, we remained there three days.<Fb>
 

 <FU>#Ac 28:13|<Fu>
 
